  "summary": "Malicious code in thepokies-review (npm)",
  "details": "Thepokies-review@1.0.0 is a casino-affiliate spam package. It ships no executable code (index.js is an empty module export) and no install scripts, but its README is SEO marketing copy promoting the online casino The Pokies, embedding affiliate links to thepokies.games and thepokies119[.]net. The package's sole purpose is to drive traffic to the gambling affiliate destinations; it contains no functional library code.",
